# English-Only Repository Artifacts

Everything written to disk or pushed to remote **MUST be in English** — code, identifiers, comments, docs, rules, skills, OpenSpec, tests, SFCC metadata, commit messages, branch names, PR titles/bodies, Jira, Confluence.

User "respond in \<language\>" applies to **chat only**, not files.
